# Testing Conventions

## Layout (Jest → Go)

| Jest | Go |
|---|---|
| `test/` helpers | `test/testutil/` |
| mocks | `test/mocks/` |
| unit specs | `test/unit/<feature>/` |
| supertest | `test/integration/` |

Jangan tambah `*_test.go` di `internal/` kecuali white-box yang wajib akses unexported.

## Pola

- Package test: `xxx_test` (black-box)
- Mock implement interface production (`Repository`)
- HTTP: `testutil.DoJSON` + `WithAPIKey` / `WithBearer`
- Assert: `github.com/stretchr/testify/require`
- Config: `testutil.Config()`

## Commands

- `make test` / `make test-unit` / `make test-integration` / `make test-cover`

## Saat feature baru

1. Unit service di `test/unit/<feature>/`
2. Kalau ada route → case di `test/integration/`
3. Reuse mock di `test/mocks/` kalau repo baru
